src/go_netip.rs adapts text acceptance and canonicalization rules from
Go 1.26.9 src/net/netip/netip.go. src/go_strconv.rs and its unicode.rs
adapt src/strconv/quote.go and isprint.go. The Unicode tables and quoting
were extracted from the CLI logging implementation. The BSD license is
in LICENSE-GO-STDLIB.

go_strconv::quote_bytes also follows strconv.Quote's malformed UTF-8 byte
escaping: each invalid byte is emitted as a hexadecimal escape while valid
Unicode runes keep the same pinned printable-table behavior.

src/go_unicode.rs adapts Go 1.26.9 unicode/letter.go SimpleFold/ToLower and the
Unicode 15.0.0 CaseRanges, asciiFold and caseOrbit tables from unicode/tables.go.
It supplies strings.EqualFold and strings.ToLower at valid UTF-8 boundaries. Original
Go Authors BSD terms are retained in LICENSE-GO-STDLIB.

